openclaw/

# ── Agent/orchestrator scratch ───────────────────────
scripts/.swarm/
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
**/.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

# ── Root-level agent identity/memory scratch ─────────
# Runtime expects these under $GORMES_HOME (not the repo root).
/IDENTITY.md
/SOUL.md
/TOOLS.md
/memory/

# ── Local third-party reference clones ───────────────
deer-flow/
/@pi2many-hermes
/@py2many-hermes

# ── Docs/site generated artifacts ────────────────────
webpages/docs/www-tests/node_modules/
webpages/docs/www-tests/test-results/
scripts/whatsapp-bridge/node_modules/

# claude-flow swarm coordination state (created by `npx claude-flow swarm init`)
